# Run artifacts, exactly as the root project ignores them.
.niki/
# The diff NIKI hands back, if a student copies it here.
changes.patch
node_modules/

# …but the starter's own config IS tracked, and it has to be: it is what makes
# the exercise zero-setup. The repository's root .gitignore excludes
# `niki.toml` everywhere so that a developer's real configuration — with their
# keys and their model choices — can never be committed. That rule is correct
# and it caught this file too.
#
# CI found it: the starter's own selftest reported "niki.toml is missing" on a
# clean checkout, because the file had never been in the repository at all.
# Nothing local would have, since it was sitting on disk.
!niki.toml
